# Wave W17-J (Route 45): fall pine — a mountainside pine of the falling road, a full warm crown in sound greens with the highlight lifted clear of the turf, on fall turf (ground baked in). The ledges’ shade tree, warmer and fuller than the frost pine behind the mountain.
